{"overview":{"Symbol":"WBTN","Name":"WEBTOON Entertainment Inc.","Description":"WEBTOON Entertainment Inc. operates a storytelling platform in the United States, Korea, Japan, and internationally. Its platform allows a community of creators and users to discover, create, and share new content. The company's platform offers stories primarily in two ways, including web-comics, a graphical comic-like medium; and web-novel platforms, optimized for reading serialized text-based content. It also provides hosting services for web-comics through web and mobile applications, and paid content, advertising and IP adaptations. The company was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in Los Angeles, California. WEBTOON Entertainment Inc. is a subsidiary of NAVER Corporation.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Communication Services","Industry":"Internet Content & Information","Address":"5700 Wilshire Blvd., Los Angeles, CA, 90036, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"1520038400","EBITDA":"-12117000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"8.95","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-2.56","RevenuePerShareTTM":"10.503","ProfitMargin":"-0.24167","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.02503","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.01611","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.25842","RevenueTTM":"1377869952","GrossProfitTTM":"333617984","DilutedEPSTTM":"-2.56","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"-0.015","AnalystTargetPrice":"12.28571","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"34.584618","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"1.1031799","PriceToBookRatio":"1.2558659","EVToRevenue":"0.722","EVToEBITDA":"-82.104","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"22.47","52WeekLow":"8.165","50DayMovingAverage":"11.8343","200DayMovingAverage":"13.4571","SharesOutstanding":"135234730","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"1.648"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"WBTN","